<p>You have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 25%, 32%, 39%, 45%</acronym> chance on dealing blight damage to cause the target to rot away, silencing, disarming, blinding or pinning them for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 5</acronym> turns. This effect has a cooldown.</p><p>At talent level 4, this affects targets in a radius 1 ball.</p><p>Your worms also have a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">7%, 12%, 16%, 19%, 22%</acronym> chance to blind, silence, disarm or pin with their melee attacks, lasting 2 turns.</p><p>The chance to apply this effect will increase with your Spellpower.</p>